  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A beam containing different types of radiation enters a region of a uniform magnetic field directed into the page. The paths of three components of the beam, labeled X, Y, and Z, are shown below.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>Which row in the table correctly identifies the particles in each path?</p>\n<div class=\"table-responsive\"><table><thead><tr><th></th><th>X</th><th>Y</th><th>Z</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr data-label=\"A\"><td>A</td><td>Alpha particle</td><td>Gamma ray</td><td>Beta particle</td></tr><tr data-label=\"B\"><td>B</td><td>Beta particle</td><td>Gamma ray</td><td>Alpha particle</td></tr><tr data-label=\"C\"><td>C</td><td>Gamma ray</td><td>Beta particle</td><td>Alpha particle</td></tr><tr data-label=\"D\"><td>D</td><td>Alpha particle</td><td>Beta particle</td><td>Gamma ray</td></tr></tbody></table></div>"
